    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d694-a2">

                <pb facs="1266" n="1142" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg1142"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 392.]</seg><lb/><dateline
                        rendition="#center">[Advertisement appearing in the Helvetia, No. 15.
                        Bienne, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1881-04-10">April 10,
                        1881</date>.—Translation.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Bureau Maritime, rue Pury 6, Neuchatel.</p>
                <p>Only 133 francs emigrants pay at our office for the journey from Havre to New
                    York, everything included, by the French mail steamers, and only 132 francs by
                    the English mail steamers. Special arrangements for persons without means.</p>
                <p>Bureau Maritime, rue Pury 6, Neuchatel.</p>
            </div>
